---
import type { CollectionEntry } from 'astro:content';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { imageWidths } from './case-study/imageWidths';
import { d2lAssets } from '../data/d2l-assets';
interface Props { project: CollectionEntry<'projects'> }
const { project } = Astro.props;
const href = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}work/${project.data.caseStudy!.slug}/`;
---
<article class="project-feature d2l-feature" aria-labelledby="d2l-feature-heading">
  <header class="feature-heading"><p class="micro">01 / Academic team redesign</p><h3 id="d2l-feature-heading">{project.data.title}</h3></header>
  <div class="feature-story"><h4>Which file will count?</h4><p>Make requirements, the selected file, and submission status easier to distinguish. The proposal keeps assignment context visible and separates file review from the submission record.</p><p class="project-boundary">Academic concept · Usability improvements remain unvalidated.</p></div>
  <figure class="project-visual">
    <a class="feature-artifacts d2l-feature-artifacts" href={href} aria-label="View the D2L Redesign case study">
      <div class="primary-frame"><span class="micro" aria-hidden="true">File review</span><Image class="primary-artifact" src={d2lAssets.file.image} widths={imageWidths(d2lAssets.file.image.width)} sizes="(max-width: 40rem) 92vw, (max-width: 64rem) 45vw, 48vw" format="webp" alt={d2lAssets.file.alt} loading="eager" decoding="async" /></div>
      <div class="supporting-frame"><span class="micro" aria-hidden="true">Submission record</span><Image class="supporting-artifact" src={d2lAssets.history.image} widths={imageWidths(d2lAssets.history.image.width)} sizes="(max-width: 40rem) 92vw, (max-width: 64rem) 45vw, 48vw" format="webp" alt={d2lAssets.history.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
    </a>
    <figcaption>Review the chosen file. Keep the submission record distinct.<span>Original team-designed interface states.</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="feature-details feature-footer"><dl class="feature-contribution"><dt>Shared contribution</dt><dd>Heuristic evaluation, task mapping, interface exploration, and prototyping.</dd></dl><div class="project-actions"><a class="text-link" href={href}>Read the D2L case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://www.figma.com/proto/piRHnDp4bwoVkKMo1mHSt7/Team--1?page-id=554%3A550&amp;node-id=554-1219&amp;scaling=scale-down&amp;content-scaling=fixed" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open D2L prototype in Figma (opens in a new tab)">Open D2L prototype in Figma <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
</article>
